OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy
OL,6,Fevening with occasional outbreaks of
OL,7,Frain, mainly across western areas.
OL,8,FRemaining cloudy through the night
OL,9,Fwith the chance of further rain at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FCloud and occasional rain
OL,13,Fdying out during morning. The
OL,14,Fafternoon will then be mainly dry with
OL,15,Fsunny spells, just the chance of the
OL,16,Fodd light shower across the Trossachs.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
